	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.supp",

		  "summary": "做奶酪需要备齐这些：\n-各种奶桶（不同奶酪用的奶不一样）\n-一口下方有热源的炼药锅\n-凝乳酶\n-盐\n-一个奶酪熟成架",

		  "elements": [
			 
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "材料备齐后，先想好要做哪种奶酪。\n\n奶酪共有 8 种，每种所用的奶的配比都不一样。\n\n各奶酪配方的用奶如下：",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	  	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.mix",

		  "summary": "硬质奶酪：\n\n- 切达干酪：牛奶\n- 高达奶酪：绵羊奶\n- 帕尔马干酪：牛奶 + 山羊奶\n- 瑞士奶酪：绵羊奶 + 山羊奶",

		  "elements": [
			 
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "\n\n软质奶酪：\n\n- 卡拉瓦娜奶酪：骆驼奶\n- 山羊奶酪：山羊奶\n- 羊乳酪：骆驼奶 + 山羊奶\n- 里科塔奶酪：骆驼奶 + 绵羊奶",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	   
	  
	  	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.milk",

		  "summary": "选好配方、备齐其他材料，就可以开始做奶酪了。",

		  "elements": [
		  
				 {
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/add_milk.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.add_milk_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
			
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "确认炼药锅下方已经加热，然后把奶倒进锅里。需要混合两种奶时，倒完一种要马上倒另一种。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	  	 {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.rennet",

		  "summary": "接着**迅速**加入凝乳酶。这一步很关键：凝乳酶加得不够快，奶就会变成奶油。",

		  "elements": [
		  
				 {
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/add_rennet.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.add_rennet_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
			
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "凝乳酶下锅后，锅里的混合物会立刻发生变化。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.curds",

		  "summary": "混合物会开始翻动，过一会儿再次变化，成为凝乳与乳清。",

		  "elements": [
		  
				 {
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/curds.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.curds_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
			
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "那是一锅泛黄的液体，白色的絮状物浮在表面，就像图里这样，还会看到气泡。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.salt",

		  "summary": "锅里装满凝乳与乳清后，下一步是对锅使用盐。",

		  "elements": [
		  						
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "盐会与乳清结合，把奶酪凝固成一整轮。\n\n取走奶酪轮之后，锅应该就空了。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	   {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.raw",

		  "summary": "接下来怎么做，取决于你做的是哪一类奶酪。\n\n如果是软质奶酪，那就到此为止，可以直接用了。 ",

		  "elements": [
		  
				 {
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/wheel.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.wheel_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
			
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "把它放下，点击即可取下一块奶酪。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	 
	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.age",

		  "summary": "如果做的是硬质奶酪，拿到的会是该种奶酪的「生」奶酪轮，还需要熟成。",

		  "elements": [
		  
				 {
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/shelf.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.shelf_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
			
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "把生奶酪轮放上奶酪熟成架让它熟成。熟成完毕时，架子上的样子会发生变化。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  },
	  
	  {
		  "type": "standard",
		  
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.place",

		  "summary": "做好的奶酪轮是可放置的方块。\n\n放下后点击就能取下一块奶酪，可以直接吃，也可以用于食物配方。",

		  "elements": [			
				{
				  "type": "image",
				  "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/cheese/wheel1.png",
				  "caption": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.chapters.cheese.wheel1_caption",
				  "image_width": 110,
				  "image_height": 62

				},
				{
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "每轮可切 4 块。\n\n特别提醒：奶酪轮一旦放下就**捡不回来**了。",
				  "text": null
				}
		  ]
	  },
	  
	    {
		  "type": "standard",
		  "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.auto",

		  "summary": "往锅里加凝乳酶或盐可以用发射器自动化。\n\n注意：往锅里加奶做不到自动化。",



		  "elements": [
		  						
			  {
				  "type": "text",
				  "literal_text": "如果奶已经熬成了奶油，取奶油桶这一步同样可以自动化。",
				  "text": null
			  }
		  ]

	  }
	  
	  
	   
	  
	 
	  
	
	  
	  
	  
	   
	  
	 
	  
	  
	  
	  
	
